sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CS->>CSMS: DataTransferRequest (vendorId = <Configured vendorId>, messageId = <Configured messageId>)
    CSMS-->>CS: DataTransferResponse (status = UnknownVendorId OR UnknownMessageId OR Rejected)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be UnknownVendorId OR UnknownMessageId OR Rejected<br>(Rejected is also allowed, because some implementers just reject the message<br>when no vendor-specific features are supported)
